{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CDUntappdRequestAdapter"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","externalID":"s:12CDUntappdKit0A14RequestAdapterP","role":"symbol","title":"CDUntappdRequestAdapter","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CDUntappdRequestAdapter","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"CDUntappdKit"}]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CDUntappdRequestAdapter"},{"kind":"text","text":" : AnyObject, "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"adapt(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs exactly once per logical API call, before the first attempt —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not once per retry attempt. If a retry occurs (see ","type":"text"},{"code":"CDUntappdRetryConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already-adapted request is resent unchanged. An adapter that refreshes an expiring token or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signs requests with a per-attempt nonce\/timestamp will not get a fresh value on retry; such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an adapter should refresh proactively before the request reaches CDUntappdKit, rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relying on being re-invoked mid-retry.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","name":"Important"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retry eligibility (see ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CDUntappdRetryConfigurati